 family and unraveling the truth.<br><br><strong>NOT THE WAY IT USED TO BE…</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.poster.avif?t=1764194091\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.webm?t=1764194091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/1f2cc4bb89e9a66a71f8c43ca3c5dbf4.mp4?t=1764194091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This warehouse doesn’t seem to add up to your memories. A sense of someone walking in the hallways envelops you with each passing moment. The anticipation of the unknown looms around every corner.<br><br><strong>HIDE AND SEEK IN THE SHADOWS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.poster.avif?t=1764194091\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.webm?t=1764194091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/8912f7ef9dc544ebce8c2f8846b8ec47.mp4?t=1764194091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You loved this game in your childhood! Now it doesn’t seem to be as fun…<br><br><strong>ESCAPE?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763460/extras/d435de8f1744169551ab7c1ed6678d25.poster.avif?t=1764194091\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.